  ],
  "duration_s": 419.167007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国深秋最惊艳的大地奇观是哪一处吗？有人说是四川九寨沟一百多处海子五彩斑斓。有人说是内蒙古额济纳数万株千年胡杨，金光冲天，对不住了，九寨沟排不进榜首，胡杨连前五都进不了，真正排在榜首的那处奇观不在中原，腹地也不在烟雨江南不年，只有十来天，整片湖水会自己换上一身，不像人间的颜色。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最惊艳的深秋大地奇观。话不多说，茶给您起好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲第十名。辽宁盘锦红海滩辽河入海口，很多人以为一入深秋，大地不是金黄，就是落叶枯黄。嗯，可辽宁盘锦彻底打破了这种成见。这片辽河入海口的湿地广达上万亩放眼望去，是一片无边无际的血红地毯，成千上万株纤弱微小的剪蓬草，在又咸又苦的泥泞海滩里扎下根。借着深秋，海风硬生生憋出全中国最浓烈纯正的鲜红。您光脚往泥滩边上一站衔，湿海风扑面吹来，头顶上是翻飞起伏的白鹤，脚下是烧到天边的红霞，一株微不足道的小草，能在最苦涩的盐碱淤泥里活出惊天动地的风骨。您说这算不算大自然的绝唱？第九名，内蒙古呼伦贝尔金秋草原夏天它是翠绿的。一入深秋，整片草原褪成了金色十万平方公里，上下一眼望过去，天和地之间只剩一条细线蔚蓝清澈的末日格勒河，像一条飘动的银色丝带，千回百转地在大地中间穿行，漫山遍野散落着成千上万个巨大的圆形草垛。落日余晖洒在草尖上，泛起一片暖光。您要是从城里忙碌的厨房和繁杂琐事里走出来往。这辽阔无垠的金色草甸上一坐，胸口那口憋了大半辈子的闷气，瞬间就能散的干干净净，天地宽到连影子都容得下，您说，还有什么事值得堵在心头。第八名，四川巴中光武山、大巴山腹地，他被人称作亚洲第一红叶山，可不是白叫的红叶一铺，就是八百里。八百里是什么概念？差不多是北京到济南那么长，数十个树种各有各的脾气，山顶先皇往下转成，再往下是朱洪紫红一层压着一层，顺着山势往沟底躺，山高沟深，早晚温差，大叶子里的色素越攒越浓。您站在山梁上往下看，满眼的红一浪接着一浪翻过来，向整座山烧着，了却一点烟都没有。大自然这回泼墨不打草稿，也不心疼颜料，慷慨德，叫人张不开嘴。您说这样的大手笔，一辈子见上一回值不值？第七名？内蒙古额济纳旗金色胡杨林，他扎根在巴丹吉林沙漠、西北边缘，是中国最古老的一片荒漠野生胡杨林。民间常说，他生儿一千年不死死而一千年不倒道而一千年不朽，整整四十四万亩苍净古墓在每年深秋仅有短短十多天的黄金窗口期，借着烈猎秋风，把积蓄一整年的力量，全数化为纯金烈焰金色的沙丘波纹与求取如铁骨的胡杨紧紧相宜，狂风掀起漫天黄沙，今夜却在沙海里燃烧的耀眼夺目。您走在粗糙滚烫的沙土上，摸一摸那皲裂如铁的苍老树皮，生命在绝境风沙里战成这般模样，换谁看一眼心头，不被震得发颤。第六名，吉林长白山天池东北第一高峰。十六座雪峰围成一圈圈出一个火山口湖，水面海拔两千一百多米，最深处三百七十多米，是火山喷发后一点点积水成的。深秋一到，峰顶先落了初雪。十六峰白得晃眼，往下一截。月化林长在森林最高的一线，满山纯金，像一条金龙盘在黑色的火山岩上，中间握着天池水蓝的发黑，像一块墨玉嵌进雪里。您站在山口冷风往领口里灌，低头是墨，抬眼是雪，侧身是金，抬样颜色挤在一个视野里，谁也不肯让谁别处的秋天是一种颜色，这儿的秋天是三重天这样的胜境。您说谁见得不屏住呼吸？从第十到第六名，盘锦的简蓬草在盐碱滩里熬出了百里红毯，呼伦贝尔把整座草原铺成了金色大海。光雾山八百里红叶烧成了火浪，额济那胡杨在无垠荒漠中狂舞。千年长白山天池用初雪与精化铸造出北国盛境，可他们还不是最惊艳的。接下来第五道第一名更厉害，有一座大山，万亩梯田，一夜之间变成了天上的镜子。有一个村子，三万多颗银杏，把黑石头老屋埋进了金子里，可排在榜首的那一处湖两岸数万亩白桦全都烧成了纯金。他是哪里？他凭什么排在九寨沟前面，下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国深秋大地真正的天花板。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 3990,
      "text": "您知道中国深秋最惊艳的大地奇观是哪一处吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4410,
      "end_ms": 9310,
      "text": "有人说是四川九寨沟一百多处海子五彩斑斓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9910,
      "end_ms": 13930,
      "text": "有人说是内蒙古额济纳数万株千年胡杨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00004",
      "start_ms": 14190,
      "end_ms": 15110,
      "text": "金光冲天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15570,
      "end_ms": 16370,
      "text": "对不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16730,
      "end_ms": 18350,
      "text": "九寨沟排不进榜首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19090,
      "end_ms": 21050,
      "text": "胡杨连前五都进不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21590,
      "end_ms": 25650,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那处奇观不在中原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25670,
      "end_ms": 29550,
      "text": "腹地也不在烟雨江南不年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29590,
      "end_ms": 30600,
      "text": "只有十来天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31220,
      "end_ms": 34060,
      "text": "整片湖水会自己换上一身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 35620,
      "text": "不像人间的颜色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36180,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最惊艳的深秋大地奇观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41820,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00015",
      "start_ms": 43000,
      "end_ms": 44360,
      "text": "茶给您起好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44780,
      "end_ms": 47340,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47660,
      "end_ms": 49860,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50300,
      "end_ms": 53920,
      "text": "辽宁盘锦红海滩辽河入海口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54580,
      "end_ms": 56380,
      "text": "很多人以为一入深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57120,
      "end_ms": 58480,
      "text": "大地不是金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00021",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 59855,
      "text": "就是落叶枯黄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00022",
      "start_ms": 60130,
      "end_ms": 60320,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60520,
      "end_ms": 63615,
      "text": "可辽宁盘锦彻底打破了这种成见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64080,
      "end_ms": 69110,
      "text": "这片辽河入海口的湿地广达上万亩放眼望去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00025",
      "start_ms": 69210,
      "end_ms": 71925,
      "text": "是一片无边无际的血红地毯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00026",
      "start_ms": 72360,
      "end_ms": 75765,
      "text": "成千上万株纤弱微小的剪蓬草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76100,
      "end_ms": 79405,
      "text": "在又咸又苦的泥泞海滩里扎下根。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00028",
      "start_ms": 79880,
      "end_ms": 80700,
      "text": "借着深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80700,
      "end_ms": 85965,
      "text": "海风硬生生憋出全中国最浓烈纯正的鲜红。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00030",
      "start_ms": 86380,
      "end_ms": 89380,
      "text": "您光脚往泥滩边上一站衔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00031",
      "start_ms": 89520,
      "end_ms": 91645,
      "text": "湿海风扑面吹来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92020,
      "end_ms": 94865,
      "text": "头顶上是翻飞起伏的白鹤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00033",
      "start_ms": 95320,
      "end_ms": 97735,
      "text": "脚下是烧到天边的红霞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00034",
      "start_ms": 98140,
      "end_ms": 100215,
      "text": "一株微不足道的小草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00035",
      "start_ms": 100780,
      "end_ms": 105725,
      "text": "能在最苦涩的盐碱淤泥里活出惊天动地的风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106420,
      "end_ms": 109195,
      "text": "您说这算不算大自然的绝唱？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00037",
      "start_ms": 109540,
      "end_ms": 110135,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00038",
      "start_ms": 110530,
      "end_ms": 115005,
      "text": "内蒙古呼伦贝尔金秋草原夏天它是翠绿的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00039",
      "start_ms": 115400,
      "end_ms": 116375,
      "text": "一入深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116790,
      "end_ms": 120820,
      "text": "整片草原褪成了金色十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00041",
      "start_ms": 120820,
      "end_ms": 122995,
      "text": "上下一眼望过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00042",
      "start_ms": 123370,
      "end_ms": 128040,
      "text": "天和地之间只剩一条细线蔚蓝清澈的末日格勒河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00043",
      "start_ms": 128200,
      "end_ms": 130815,
      "text": "像一条飘动的银色丝带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00044",
      "start_ms": 131280,
      "end_ms": 134625,
      "text": "千回百转地在大地中间穿行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00045",
      "start_ms": 135220,
      "end_ms": 140305,
      "text": "漫山遍野散落着成千上万个巨大的圆形草垛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00046",
      "start_ms": 141030,
      "end_ms": 143390,
      "text": "落日余晖洒在草尖上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00047",
      "start_ms": 143610,
      "end_ms": 145165,
      "text": "泛起一片暖光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00048",
      "start_ms": 145600,
      "end_ms": 150360,
      "text": "您要是从城里忙碌的厨房和繁杂琐事里走出来往。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00049",
      "start_ms": 150360,
      "end_ms": 153175,
      "text": "这辽阔无垠的金色草甸上一坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00050",
      "start_ms": 153670,
      "end_ms": 156435,
      "text": "胸口那口憋了大半辈子的闷气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00051",
      "start_ms": 156850,
      "end_ms": 159065,
      "text": "瞬间就能散的干干净净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00052",
      "start_ms": 159520,
      "end_ms": 161775,
      "text": "天地宽到连影子都容得下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00053",
      "start_ms": 162230,
      "end_ms": 162570,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00054",
      "start_ms": 162570,
      "end_ms": 164585,
      "text": "还有什么事值得堵在心头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00055",
      "start_ms": 164930,
      "end_ms": 165745,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00056",
      "start_ms": 166230,
      "end_ms": 169295,
      "text": "四川巴中光武山、大巴山腹地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00057",
      "start_ms": 169640,
      "end_ms": 172295,
      "text": "他被人称作亚洲第一红叶山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00058",
      "start_ms": 172700,
      "end_ms": 175370,
      "text": "可不是白叫的红叶一铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00059",
      "start_ms": 175370,
      "end_ms": 176165,
      "text": "就是八百里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00060",
      "start_ms": 176540,
      "end_ms": 177865,
      "text": "八百里是什么概念？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00061",
      "start_ms": 178350,
      "end_ms": 181185,
      "text": "差不多是北京到济南那么长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00062",
      "start_ms": 181620,
      "end_ms": 185085,
      "text": "数十个树种各有各的脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00063",
      "start_ms": 185900,
      "end_ms": 188935,
      "text": "山顶先皇往下转成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00064",
      "start_ms": 189480,
      "end_ms": 193855,
      "text": "再往下是朱洪紫红一层压着一层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00065",
      "start_ms": 194320,
      "end_ms": 196595,
      "text": "顺着山势往沟底躺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00066",
      "start_ms": 197000,
      "end_ms": 197915,
      "text": "山高沟深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00067",
      "start_ms": 198550,
      "end_ms": 199610,
      "text": "早晚温差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00068",
      "start_ms": 199610,
      "end_ms": 203325,
      "text": "大叶子里的色素越攒越浓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00069",
      "start_ms": 203730,
      "end_ms": 206015,
      "text": "您站在山梁上往下看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00070",
      "start_ms": 206600,
      "end_ms": 209755,
      "text": "满眼的红一浪接着一浪翻过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00071",
      "start_ms": 210200,
      "end_ms": 211820,
      "text": "向整座山烧着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00072",
      "start_ms": 211820,
      "end_ms": 213985,
      "text": "了却一点烟都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214710,
      "end_ms": 217545,
      "text": "大自然这回泼墨不打草稿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217840,
      "end_ms": 219205,
      "text": "也不心疼颜料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00075",
      "start_ms": 219710,
      "end_ms": 220490,
      "text": "慷慨德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00076",
      "start_ms": 220490,
      "end_ms": 221745,
      "text": "叫人张不开嘴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00077",
      "start_ms": 222170,
      "end_ms": 223855,
      "text": "您说这样的大手笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00078",
      "start_ms": 224180,
      "end_ms": 226435,
      "text": "一辈子见上一回值不值？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00079",
      "start_ms": 226820,
      "end_ms": 227575,
      "text": "第七名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00080",
      "start_ms": 228140,
      "end_ms": 230985,
      "text": "内蒙古额济纳旗金色胡杨林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00081",
      "start_ms": 231640,
      "end_ms": 234715,
      "text": "他扎根在巴丹吉林沙漠、西北边缘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00082",
      "start_ms": 235200,
      "end_ms": 239065,
      "text": "是中国最古老的一片荒漠野生胡杨林。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00083",
      "start_ms": 239520,
      "end_ms": 240645,
      "text": "民间常说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00084",
      "start_ms": 241100,
      "end_ms": 246225,
      "text": "他生儿一千年不死死而一千年不倒道而一千年不朽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00085",
      "start_ms": 246680,
      "end_ms": 253715,
      "text": "整整四十四万亩苍净古墓在每年深秋仅有短短十多天的黄金窗口期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00086",
      "start_ms": 254220,
      "end_ms": 255360,
      "text": "借着烈猎秋风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00087",
      "start_ms": 255440,
      "end_ms": 257300,
      "text": "把积蓄一整年的力量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00088",
      "start_ms": 257340,
      "end_ms": 265405,
      "text": "全数化为纯金烈焰金色的沙丘波纹与求取如铁骨的胡杨紧紧相宜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00089",
      "start_ms": 265840,
      "end_ms": 268105,
      "text": "狂风掀起漫天黄沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00090",
      "start_ms": 268510,
      "end_ms": 272245,
      "text": "今夜却在沙海里燃烧的耀眼夺目。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00091",
      "start_ms": 272660,
      "end_ms": 275495,
      "text": "您走在粗糙滚烫的沙土上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00092",
      "start_ms": 275960,
      "end_ms": 278835,
      "text": "摸一摸那皲裂如铁的苍老树皮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00093",
      "start_ms": 279490,
      "end_ms": 282605,
      "text": "生命在绝境风沙里战成这般模样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00094",
      "start_ms": 283000,
      "end_ms": 284910,
      "text": "换谁看一眼心头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00095",
      "start_ms": 284910,
      "end_ms": 286225,
      "text": "不被震得发颤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00096",
      "start_ms": 286640,
      "end_ms": 287385,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00097",
      "start_ms": 287940,
      "end_ms": 291725,
      "text": "吉林长白山天池东北第一高峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00098",
      "start_ms": 292270,
      "end_ms": 297350,
      "text": "十六座雪峰围成一圈圈出一个火山口湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00099",
      "start_ms": 298210,
      "end_ms": 300690,
      "text": "水面海拔两千一百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00100",
      "start_ms": 301210,
      "end_ms": 303330,
      "text": "最深处三百七十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00101",
      "start_ms": 303870,
      "end_ms": 307270,
      "text": "是火山喷发后一点点积水成的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00102",
      "start_ms": 307650,
      "end_ms": 308590,
      "text": "深秋一到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00103",
      "start_ms": 308830,
      "end_ms": 310510,
      "text": "峰顶先落了初雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00104",
      "start_ms": 310930,
      "end_ms": 312850,
      "text": "十六峰白得晃眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00105",
      "start_ms": 313250,
      "end_ms": 314230,
      "text": "往下一截。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00106",
      "start_ms": 314770,
      "end_ms": 317570,
      "text": "月化林长在森林最高的一线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00107",
      "start_ms": 317910,
      "end_ms": 319070,
      "text": "满山纯金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00108",
      "start_ms": 319670,
      "end_ms": 323520,
      "text": "像一条金龙盘在黑色的火山岩上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00109",
      "start_ms": 323940,
      "end_ms": 327540,
      "text": "中间握着天池水蓝的发黑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00110",
      "start_ms": 328280,
      "end_ms": 330640,
      "text": "像一块墨玉嵌进雪里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00111",
      "start_ms": 330960,
      "end_ms": 334240,
      "text": "您站在山口冷风往领口里灌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00112",
      "start_ms": 334680,
      "end_ms": 335560,
      "text": "低头是墨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00113",
      "start_ms": 336040,
      "end_ms": 337000,
      "text": "抬眼是雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00114",
      "start_ms": 337380,
      "end_ms": 338360,
      "text": "侧身是金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00115",
      "start_ms": 339000,
      "end_ms": 341480,
      "text": "抬样颜色挤在一个视野里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00116",
      "start_ms": 341840,
      "end_ms": 345540,
      "text": "谁也不肯让谁别处的秋天是一种颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00117",
      "start_ms": 346220,
      "end_ms": 350820,
      "text": "这儿的秋天是三重天这样的胜境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00118",
      "start_ms": 351440,
      "end_ms": 353735,
      "text": "您说谁见得不屏住呼吸？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00119",
      "start_ms": 354130,
      "end_ms": 355825,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00120",
      "start_ms": 356420,
      "end_ms": 360535,
      "text": "盘锦的简蓬草在盐碱滩里熬出了百里红毯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00121",
      "start_ms": 361190,
      "end_ms": 364305,
      "text": "呼伦贝尔把整座草原铺成了金色大海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00122",
      "start_ms": 364820,
      "end_ms": 367455,
      "text": "光雾山八百里红叶烧成了火浪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00123",
      "start_ms": 367950,
      "end_ms": 370950,
      "text": "额济那胡杨在无垠荒漠中狂舞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00124",
      "start_ms": 370970,
      "end_ms": 376665,
      "text": "千年长白山天池用初雪与精化铸造出北国盛境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00125",
      "start_ms": 377240,
      "end_ms": 379505,
      "text": "可他们还不是最惊艳的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00126",
      "start_ms": 379970,
      "end_ms": 382745,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00127",
      "start_ms": 383470,
      "end_ms": 384575,
      "text": "有一座大山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00128",
      "start_ms": 385000,
      "end_ms": 386065,
      "text": "万亩梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00129",
      "start_ms": 386450,
      "end_ms": 388975,
      "text": "一夜之间变成了天上的镜子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00130",
      "start_ms": 389640,
      "end_ms": 390655,
      "text": "有一个村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00131",
      "start_ms": 391090,
      "end_ms": 392455,
      "text": "三万多颗银杏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00132",
      "start_ms": 392810,
      "end_ms": 395585,
      "text": "把黑石头老屋埋进了金子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00133",
      "start_ms": 395960,
      "end_ms": 402435,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那一处湖两岸数万亩白桦全都烧成了纯金。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00134",
      "start_ms": 403230,
      "end_ms": 404025,
      "text": "他是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00135",
      "start_ms": 404560,
      "end_ms": 406855,
      "text": "他凭什么排在九寨沟前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00136",
      "start_ms": 407490,
      "end_ms": 409555,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00137",
      "start_ms": 410150,
      "end_ms": 411275,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00138",
      "start_ms": 411520,
      "end_ms": 414315,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a7626c5b80217c24_s00139",
      "start_ms": 414930,
      "end_ms": 418865,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国深秋大地真正的天花板。"
    }
  ],
